        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scaredy Cat</strong> is a short, emotional narrative adventure where you play as a young kitty trying to prove she’s brave enough to cross the darkest part of the forest to find a rare flower  alone. A journey that starts as a simple dare quickly becomes something deeper, as kitty meets the inhabitants of the forest and has to face the truth about herself. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short but heartfelt experience (~10–20 minutes);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stylized locations of the game world;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny dialogue and interesting story twists;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, accessible to all players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was made as a part of a Summer Studies course at Kajaani University of Applied Sciences in just a few months. This is out first Steam release! :)</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scaredy Cat</strong> is a short, emotional narrative adventure where you play as a young kitty trying to prove she’s brave enough to cross the darkest part of the forest to find a rare flower  alone. A journey that starts as a simple dare quickly becomes something deeper, as kitty meets the inhabitants of the forest and has to face the truth about herself. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short but heartfelt experience (~10–20 minutes);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stylized locations of the game world;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny dialogue and interesting story twists;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, accessible to all players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was made as a part of a Summer Studies course at Kajaani University of Applied Sciences in just a few months. This is out first Steam release! :)</p>",
        "short_description": "A scaredy cat steps into the forest alone to find a rare flower for her friends — but some journeys are more than they seem.",
